      "subject": "gore ba ntlose kgolego",
      "rationale": "לרחקה מעל מקדשי: ba dira bjale gore Elohim a tloge bokgethwa, goba bokgonagona bja gore o tlogetše — mehuta ya diphetolelo e fapana."
